%description:
Tests TCP Fast Open (RFC 7413) with two connections of the same client and
server. Connection 1 has no cached cookie: its SYN requests one with an empty
Fast Open option, and the SYN-ACK of the server gives a cookie of 8 bytes,
which the client caches. Connection 2 has the cached cookie: its SYN waits
for the SEND at t=0.5 s and carries the cookie and the 200 bytes. The server
checks the cookie (strict validation, the default), its SYN-ACK acknowledges
the SYN and the data (ack 125201), and its application receives the 200 bytes
before the handshake completes.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.fastOpen=true
*.cli_app.tOpen2=0.5s
*.cli_app.active2=true
*.cli_app.localPort2=1001
*.cli_app.tSend2=0.5s
*.cli_app.sendBytes2=200B
*.cli_app.fastOpen2=true
*.srv_app.tOpen2=0.5s
*.srv_app.localPort2=2000

*.cli_tcp.fastopenClientEnabled = true
*.srv_tcp.fastopenServerEnabled = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.001 A001] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize NOP NOP FastOpen(cookieLen=0)
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[0.003 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize NOP NOP FastOpen(cookieLen=8)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.501 A003] A.1001 > B.2000: S 125000:125200(200) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize NOP NOP FastOpen(cookieLen=8)
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[0.503 B002] A.1001 < B.2000: A S 125500:125500(0) ack 125201 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
TcpTestNet1.srv_app: received 200 bytes in 1 packets
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
